# Wave T35 (Lotus Cove kit): cobblefloor — Lotus Cove City's registered
# street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix; the
# desire-path tiers key on it). COBBLE HARBOUR STONE: a mosaic of small
# rounded river cobbles — warm grey and lavender-grey stones in pale
# sand joints, sparse shell flecks. A round-stone mosaic is structurally
# unlike Fairhaven's running-bond quay slabs, Blossom's large inlay
# slabs, Copperton's square quarry flags, Lilac's bronze lattice grid,
# Mistford's planks and Beacon's bolted decking.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T35-LOTUSCOVE-PLAN.md.)
